Best paired with the 'Paris Commune' Achievement. Releasing {{flag|Occitania}} fully after having deleted all wine fields in their country can help, as they also have an obsession with wine. Alternatively, trade agreements with {{flag|Spain}} or {{flag|Italy}} will help as both Italian cultures, Basque and Catalan also has an obsession with wine.
